息が耳に触れた 二人 Ah A B C 続かない
Breath touching our ears, the two of us, Ah... A-B-C doesn't last.

269
00:37:25,032 --> 00:37:31,812
そんなんじゃダメじゃない だって ココルの奥は 違うんじゃない? あたしの青春
Isn't that no good? Because deep in our hearts, isn't it different? My youth...

270
00:37:32,232 --> 00:37:37,012
そんなもんじゃない 熱く奥で果てたいよ
Isn't like that at all. I want to burn out deep inside with passion.

271
00:37:37,012 --> 00:37:44,812
きット キミじゃなきゃやだよ あたし イケナイ太陽
Surely it has to be you, I am the forbidden sun.

272
00:38:09,172 --> 00:38:15,072
交わす言葉の 記憶遠く 口元の動きに揺れ動く
Memories of exchanged words fade far away, swaying with the movement of lips.

273
00:38:15,292 --> 00:38:22,072
濡れた髪を撫でた そして Ah A B C 続かない
Stroking wet hair, and then Ah... A-B-C doesn't last.

274
00:38:25,832 --> 00:38:32,792
そんなんじゃダメじゃない だって ココルの奥は 違うんじゃない?
Isn't that no good? Because deep in our hearts, isn't it different?

275
00:38:32,792 --> 00:38:39,172
オレの青春 そんなもんじゃない 熱く奥で果てたいよ
My youth... Isn't like that at all. I want to burn out deep inside with passion.

276
00:38:39,172 --> 00:38:45,372
きっと キミじゃなきゃやだよ オレは イケナイ太陽
Surely it has to be you, I am the forbidden sun.

277
00:38:45,372 --> 00:38:52,812
絡み合う糸は キミとオレを結ぶ赤い糸
Entwining threads are the red threads binding you and me together.

278
00:39:23,292 --> 00:39:27,812
いや、この曲、番長のセクシーが溢れてていいですね。
Man, this song is overflowing with Bancho's sexy vibe, it's great.

279
00:39:27,812 --> 00:39:31,452
いやちょっとね、87になりましたね。
Well, you know, it hit 87.

280
00:39:31,452 --> 00:39:35,092
87点だよ。熱かった！ そして番長の動きも激熱でした。
87 points! That was intense! And Bancho's movements were super heated too.

281
00:39:35,092 --> 00:39:39,572
お姉ちゃんだから！お姉ちゃんだからね。お姉ちゃんだからさ。
Because I'm an older sister! Because I'm an older sister. Because I'm an older sister.

282
00:39:39,572 --> 00:39:42,652
お姉ちゃく食いついた。お姉ちゃく食いついた。
Big sis really went for it. Big sis really jumped right in.

283
00:39:42,652 --> 00:39:46,412
踊り替えってね。いや、すごかった。急にさのフェスですね。
Dancing switch, huh? Man, that was amazing. Suddenly it turned into a summer festival vibe.

284
00:39:46,412 --> 00:39:50,592
そうですね、さっきからちょっとね。あの、夏セキセキセロ…というか何というか。
That's right, since a little while ago... um, summer seki seki zero... or whatever you want to call it.

285
00:39:50,592 --> 00:39:54,032
ちょうどね、出たばっかだからね。MV番宣。
It just came out right now, after all. The MV promo.

286
00:39:54,032 --> 00:39:56,872
なんだかんだ言いたくなってきたな。
You're starting to want to say stuff like that!

287
00:39:56,872 --> 00:40:00,056
ま、そういう感じのね、選曲も続きますよということで。
Well, song choices like that will keep coming.

288
00:40:57,164 --> 00:41:00,864
夕月夜 顔だす 消えてく子供の声
An evening moon appears, along with fading children's voices...

289
00:41:01,564 --> 00:41:21,064
遠く遠くこの空のどこかに 君はいるんだろう
Far, far away, somewhere in this sky, you must be there...

290
00:41:21,564 --> 00:41:28,564
夏の終わりに 2人で抜け出した
At the end of summer, the two of us slipped away...

291
00:41:29,064 --> 00:41:40,564
この公園で見つけた あの星座何か覚えてる？
Do you remember that constellation we found in this park?

292
00:41:41,064 --> 00:41:49,564
会えなくても記憶をたどって 同じ幸せを見たいんだ
Even if we can't meet, I want to trace our memories and see that same happiness.

293
00:41:50,064 --> 00:41:59,064
あの香りとともに 花火がぱっと開く
Along with that scent, fireworks burst open...

294
00:41:59,564 --> 00:42:08,564
行きたいよ 君のところへ 今すぐかけだして 行きたいよ
I want to go to where you are, I want to run there right now...

295
00:42:09,064 --> 00:42:18,064
真っ暗で何も見えない 怖くても大丈夫
Pitch black, I can't see a thing, but even if I'm scared, it'll be alright.

296
00:42:18,564 --> 00:42:27,564
数えきれない星空が 今もずっとここにあるんだよ
Countless starry skies are still right here, even now.

297
00:42:28,064 --> 00:42:39,064
泣かないよ 昔 君と見た きれいな空だったから
I won't cry, because it was the beautiful sky I once saw with you.

298
00:42:41,564 --> 00:42:50,564
あの道まで響く 靴の音が耳に残る
The sound of footsteps echoing down that path lingers in my ears.

299
00:42:51,064 --> 00:43:04,564
大きな自分の影を見つめて想うのだろう
Staring at my own large shadow, I must be reminiscing...

300
00:43:05,064 --> 00:43:14,564
ちっとも変わらないはずなのに せつない気持ちふくらんでく
Even though nothing should have changed, these painful feelings keep growing...

301
00:43:15,064 --> 00:43:23,064
どんなに想ったって 君はもういない
No matter how much I think of you, you're no longer here.

302
00:43:23,564 --> 00:43:32,564
行きたいよ 君のそばに 小さくても小さくても
I want to go to your side, no matter how small, how small...

303
00:43:33,064 --> 00:43:39,564
1番に君が好きだよ 強くいられる
I love you more than anyone, it gives me the strength to stay strong...

304
00:43:40,064 --> 00:43:48,564
願いを流れ星に そっと唱えてみたけれど
I softly whispered my wish to a shooting star, but...

305
00:43:49,064 --> 00:44:04,564
泣かないよ 届くだろう きれいな空に
I won't cry, it will reach you, up in the beautiful sky...

306
00:44:15,564 --> 00:44:29,064
会えなくても記憶をたどって 同じ幸せを見たいんだ
Even if we can't meet, I want to trace our memories and see that same happiness.

307
00:44:29,564 --> 00:44:37,564
あの香りとともに 花火がぱっと開く
Along with that scent, fireworks burst open...

308
00:44:38,064 --> 00:44:48,064
行きたいよ 君のところへ 小さな手をにぎりしめて
I want to go to where you are, tightly holding your small hand...

309
00:44:48,564 --> 00:45:00,064
泣きたいよ それは それは きれいな空だった
I want to cry, it was, it was such a beautiful sky...

310
00:45:00,245 --> 00:45:19,065
願いを流れ星に そっと唱えてみたけれど 泣きたいよ 届かない 想いをこの空に…
I whispered my wish to a shooting star, but my tearful, unreachable feelings still drift into this sky...

311
00:45:41,085 --> 00:45:43,225
イェーイ！ありがとう！
Yay! Thank you!

312
00:45:45,385 --> 00:45:46,925
すごい！ハイタッチ！ハイタッチマジでマジで
Amazing! High five! High five, seriously!

313
00:45:48,165 --> 00:45:50,345
イェーイ！ごめん！
Yay! Sorry!

314
00:45:52,165 --> 00:45:53,765
ちょっと悲しい感じなっちゃった
It got a bit of a sad vibe.

315
00:45:56,329 --> 00:45:57,569
プラネタリウムでした！
That was "Planetarium"!

316
00:45:57,729 --> 00:45:59,109
よかったね〜！
It was so good!

317
00:45:59,309 --> 00:46:01,769
もうライブパフォーマンスやんマジで！
That was seriously like a live performance!

318
00:46:02,399 --> 00:46:04,259
泣きそうすぎるやろ。
It's almost too moving to handle.

319
00:46:05,109 --> 00:46:06,209
よっしゃ！
Alright!

320
00:46:06,409 --> 00:46:07,769
もう一回聴きたい！
I want to hear it again!

321
00:46:07,969 --> 00:46:09,389
あの、体力がない。
Well, we don't have the stamina.

322
00:46:09,729 --> 00:46:10,669
あ、そうだ。
Ah, right.

323
00:46:10,869 --> 00:46:12,829
体力か。えーじゃあ
Stamina, huh. Well then,

324
00:46:13,189 --> 00:46:15,429
かなで、歌う？一緒に？いや、やんない？
Kanade, want to sing? Together? No, you won't?

325
00:46:16,369 --> 00:46:18,229
やりたい！みんな！
I want to! Everyone!

326
00:46:18,529 --> 00:46:21,469
なんだと？あの曲結構いっちゃいますか。
What's that? Should we go with that song?

327
00:46:21,929 --> 00:46:24,069
え？何々？なんだと思う？
Eh? What? What do you think?

328
00:46:24,389 --> 00:46:27,509
やっぱお星さまがキラキラしたらもう回キラキラしたいんじゃないの？
After all, if the stars are sparkling, don't you want them to sparkle again?

329
00:46:27,869 --> 00:46:29,769
だってサビ終わったら外寝ちゃう？
Because after the chorus finishes, do you fall asleep outside?

330
00:46:30,059 --> 00:46:31,329
いいか！それ？
Is that fine?!

331
00:46:32,489 --> 00:46:33,849
なんの曲かな〜。
I wonder what song it is.

332
00:46:34,049 --> 00:46:35,909
じゃあ行きましょう！お願いします！
Then let's go! Please!

333
00:47:06,572 --> 00:47:08,872
午前二時フキリに 望遠鏡を担いでた
At 2 AM at the railroad crossing, I was carrying a telescope.

334
00:47:12,872 --> 00:47:15,572
ベルトに結んだラジオ 雨は降らないらしい
With a radio tied to my belt, looks like it won't rain.

335
00:47:21,272 --> 00:47:24,572
二分後に君が来た 大袈裟な荷物しょって来た
Two minutes later you came, carrying exaggerated luggage.

336
00:47:27,072 --> 00:47:30,072
始めようか 天体観測 ほうき星を探して
Shall we begin our astronomical observation, searching for a shooting star?

337
00:47:31,072 --> 00:47:37,072
深い闇に飲まれないように 精一杯だった
We tried our hardest not to be swallowed by the deep darkness.

338
00:47:39,072 --> 00:47:44,072
君の震える手を 握ろうとしたあの日は
On that day when I tried to hold your trembling hand,

339
00:47:44,872 --> 00:47:49,072
見えないモノを見ようとして 望遠鏡を覗き込んだ
I tried to see the invisible and peered through the telescope.

340
00:47:50,272 --> 00:47:54,072
静寂を切り裂いて いくつも声が生まれたよ
Tearing through the silence, many voices were born.

341
00:47:55,572 --> 00:48:01,072
明日が僕らを呼んだって 返事もろくにしなかった
Even when tomorrow called out to us, we barely answered.

342
00:48:02,072 --> 00:48:07,072
『イマ』というほうき星 君と二人追いかけていた
Chasing the shooting star called "Now" together with you.

343
00:48:12,072 --> 00:48:19,072
気付けばいつだって ひたすら何か探している 幸せの定義とか 哀しみの置き場とか
Before we knew it, we're always searching for something—the definition of happiness, or where to put our sorrow.

344
00:48:22,572 --> 00:48:26,572
生まれたら死ぬまで ずっと探している
From birth until death, we keep searching forever.

345
00:48:27,572 --> 00:48:33,572
さぁ 始めようか 天体観測 ほうき星を探して 今まで見つけたモノは
Now, shall we begin our astronomical observation, searching for a shooting star? Everything we've found so far,

346
00:48:37,572 --> 00:48:40,072
全部覚えている
we remember it all.

347
00:48:40,572 --> 00:48:45,572
君の震える手を 握れなかった痛みも
Even the pain of not being able to hold your trembling hand.

348
00:48:46,072 --> 00:48:51,072
知らないモノを知ろうとして 望遠鏡を覗き込んだ
Trying to know the unknown, I peered through the telescope.

349
00:48:51,572 --> 00:48:57,072
暗闇を照らすような 微かな光探したよ
I searched for a faint light that would illuminate the darkness.

350
00:48:57,572 --> 00:49:05,572
そうして知った痛みを 未だに僕は覚えている 『イマ』というほうき星 今も一人追いかけている
And I still remember the pain I came to know, still chasing the shooting star called "Now" all by myself.

351
00:49:11,072 --> 00:49:15,072
背が伸びるにつれて 伝えた事も増えてった
As I grew taller, the things I wanted to convey also increased.

352
00:49:19,072 --> 00:49:23,072
宛名の無い手紙も 崩れる程重くなった
Letters with no recipient also became heavy enough to collapse.

353
00:49:24,072 --> 00:49:30,072
僕は元気でいるよ 心配事も少ないよ ただひとつ 今も思い出すよ
I'm doing well, and I have few worries. Only one thing I still remember now—

354
00:49:36,572 --> 00:49:43,072
予報外れの雨に 打たれて泣き出しそうな 君の震える手を
Your trembling hand, about to burst into tears, beaten by an unforecasted rain.

355
00:49:44,072 --> 00:49:49,072
握れなかったあの日を 見えてるモノを見落として
That day when I couldn't hold it, overlooking what was right in front of us.

356
00:49:49,572 --> 00:49:57,072
望遠鏡をまた担いで 静寂と暗闇の 帰り道を駆け抜けた
Carrying the telescope once more, we dashed through the quiet, dark way back home.

357
00:50:51,430 --> 00:50:52,610
なんでステップ踏んでんだよ
Why are you doing steps?!

358
00:50:52,730 --> 00:50:53,550
めっちゃ踊ってくれてた
She was dancing so hard!

359
00:50:55,850 --> 00:50:58,350
踊ってたたって言うかパフォーマンス？
Dancing, or rather... a performance?

360
00:50:58,610 --> 00:50:59,810
体力が勝手に...
My body just moved on its own...

361
00:50:59,930 --> 00:51:01,390
二人でね、ポキポキ探しに行ってたんだよ。
The two of us went looking for some knuckle-cracking.

362
00:51:02,210 --> 00:51:04,310
ああ、肩痛かったね。
Ah, my shoulders hurt.

363
00:51:04,890 --> 00:51:06,210
めっちゃ歩き回っちゃった。
We walked around so much.

364
00:51:07,530 --> 00:51:08,650
歩き回ってたね。
You really did walk around.

365
00:51:09,190 --> 00:51:10,850
ちょっとヘトヘト。
I'm a bit exhausted.

366
00:51:11,050 --> 00:51:12,710
１曲目からもうヘトヘトヘトだからね。
From the very first song, we're totally exhausted.

367
00:51:13,330 --> 00:51:16,370
でもね、このままちょっとラーデントバンチョーの二人のが聞きたいの、なんて思ってるんですけれど。
But you know, we were thinking we'd love to hear a duet from Raden and Bancho.

368
00:51:16,470 --> 00:51:16,890
いいや！
No way!

369
00:51:22,510 --> 00:51:24,030
いや、そうじゃなくて！
No, that's not it!

370
00:51:24,170 --> 00:51:25,830
チャリで駆け上がりますか？
Shall we ride bikes and dash up?

371
00:51:26,590 --> 00:51:28,990
チャリで行きましょう、チャリで行ってください。
Let's go by bike, please go by bike.

372
00:51:31,490 --> 00:51:32,490
じゃあ準備いいですか？
Are you ready?

373
00:51:32,490 --> 00:51:33,350
オッケー！はい！
Okay! Yes!

374
00:51:33,470 --> 00:51:34,990
じゃあ音楽お願いします！
Then please start the music!

375
00:51:37,230 --> 00:51:40,580
[Title: 夏色]
[Title: Summer Color]

376
00:51:49,103 --> 00:51:52,783
駐車場のネコは アクビをしながら
The cat in the parking lot yawns as...

377
00:51:52,963 --> 00:51:56,673
今日も一日を過ごしてゆく
...it spends another day going by.

378
00:51:56,963 --> 00:52:00,753
何も変わらない 穏やかな街並み
The townscape is peaceful, nothing ever changes.

379
00:52:04,683 --> 00:52:08,653
みんな夏が来たって 浮かれ気分なのに
Everyone's excited that summer has finally come...

380
00:52:08,803 --> 00:52:14,413
君は一人さえない顔してるネ そうだ君に
...yet you've got such a downcast look. That's right, there's something...

381
00:52:14,543 --> 00:52:19,043
見せたいものがあるんだ 大きな五時半の夕焼け
...I want to show you: a huge 5:30 sunset.

382
00:52:23,593 --> 00:52:27,853
子供の頃と同じように 海も空も雲も
Just like when we were kids, painting the sea, sky, clouds...

383
00:52:27,993 --> 00:52:32,493
僕等さえも 染めていくから…
...and even the two of us in colors...

384
00:52:33,553 --> 00:52:39,393
この長い長い下り坂を 君を自転車の後ろに乗せて
Riding down this long, long slope with you on the back of my bicycle,

385
00:52:40,313 --> 00:52:47,463
ブレーキいっぱい握りしめて ゆっくりゆっくり下ってく
gripping the brakes as hard as I can, riding down slowly, slowly.

386
00:52:58,321 --> 00:53:02,211
風鈴の音でウトウトしながら
Drowsing to the sound of wind chimes,

387
00:53:02,581 --> 00:53:06,411
夢見ごこで ヨダレをたらしてる
drooling away in a dreamlike state.

388
00:53:06,741 --> 00:53:13,991
Woh… いつもと同じ 網戸ごしの風の匂い
Woh... The scent of the breeze through the screen door, just like always.

389
00:53:15,621 --> 00:53:19,541
休日でみんなも ゴロゴロしてるのに
Even though everyone's just lounging around on their day off,

390
00:53:19,721 --> 00:53:23,831
君は随分忙しい顔をしてるネ
you've got such a terribly busy look on your face.

391
00:53:24,031 --> 00:53:28,171
そうだいつかの あの場所へ行こう
That's right, let's go to that place from before.

392
00:53:28,401 --> 00:53:32,531
真夏の夜の波の音は 不思議な程心静かになる
The sound of waves on a midsummer night calms the heart so strangely.

393
00:53:33,521 --> 00:53:36,951
少しだけ全て忘れて
Forgetting everything just for a little while,

394
00:53:37,121 --> 00:53:41,441
波の音の中 包まれていく
getting wrapped up in the sound of the waves.

395
00:53:44,281 --> 00:53:48,941
この細い細い裏道を抜けて 誰もない大きな夜の海見ながら
Slipping through this narrow, narrow backstreet, looking out at the empty, vast night sea,

396
00:53:52,641 --> 00:53:59,021
線香花火に二人で ゆっくりゆっくり火をつける
lighting sparklers together, slowly, slowly lighting the flame.

397
00:54:02,911 --> 00:54:07,021
いつか君の涙が こぼれおちそうになったら
If ever your tears look like they're about to spill over,

398
00:54:07,231 --> 00:54:11,531
何もしてあげられないけど 少しでもそばにいるよ…
even though I can't do anything for you, I'll stay by your side at least...

399
00:54:12,521 --> 00:54:16,561
この長い長い下り坂を 君を自転車の後ろに乗せて
Riding down this long, long slope with you on the back of my bicycle,

400
00:54:17,461 --> 00:54:26,621
ブレーキいっぱい握りしめて ゆっくりゆっくり下ってく
gripping the brakes as hard as I can, riding down slowly, slowly.

401
00:54:28,611 --> 00:54:36,961
ゆっくりゆっくり下ってく…
Riding down slowly, slowly...

402
00:54:39,191 --> 00:54:44,671
Woo! めっちゃ楽しかったね
Woo! That was so much fun!

403
00:54:50,080 --> 00:54:56,168
夏だね！ありがとうございました！
It's summer! Thank you very much!

404
00:55:00,210 --> 00:55:02,410
ポケットのコイン それと
Pocket change and...

405
00:55:02,600 --> 00:55:05,240
You wanna be my Friend?

406
00:55:05,470 --> 00:55:08,470
We are, We are on the cruise!

407
00:55:08,880 --> 00:55:16,570
ウィーアー！
We are!

408
00:55:16,810 --> 00:55:19,430
ウィーアー！ ウィーアー！
We are! We are!

409
00:55:19,710 --> 00:55:22,150
ウィーアー！ ウィーアー！
We are! We are!

410
00:55:22,340 --> 00:55:25,130
ウィーアー！ ウィーアー！
We are! We are!

411
00:55:25,310 --> 00:55:28,110
ウィーアー！ ウィーアー！
We are! We are!

412
00:55:28,290 --> 00:55:31,110
ウィーアー！ ウィーアー！
We are! We are!

413
00:55:31,290 --> 00:55:34,110
ウィーアー！ ウィーアー！
We are! We are!

414
